sequenceDiagram
    participant Sender
    participant Receiver
    participant SignalingServer

    Note over Sender,Receiver: WebRTC Connection Setup
    Sender->>SignalingServer: Create Offer (SDP)
    SignalingServer->>Receiver: Forward Offer
    Receiver->>SignalingServer: Create Answer (SDP)
    SignalingServer-->>Sender: Forward Answer
    Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: SdpExchanged

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Data Channel Opens

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Nonce Exchange
    Sender->>Receiver: RTCNonceMessage {nonce: sender_nonce}
    Receiver-->>Sender: RTCNonceMessage {nonce: receiver_nonce}
    Note over Sender,Receiver: Combined nonce = sender_nonce || receiver_nonce

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Token Exchange (Authentication)
    Sender->>Receiver: RTCTokenRequest {token: signed_token}
    Note over Receiver: Verify token signature (optional)
    alt Token verification fails
        Receiver-->>Sender: RTCTokenResponse::InvalidSignature
        Note over Sender: Connection closed
    else Token valid, PIN required
        Receiver-->>Sender: RTCTokenResponse::PinRequired {token}
    else Token valid, no PIN required
        Receiver-->>Sender: RTCTokenResponse::Ok {token}
    end

    opt Receiver requires PIN
        Note over Sender: Status: PinRequired
        loop Until correct PIN or max attempts
            Sender->>Receiver: RTCPinMessage {pin}
            alt Correct PIN
                Receiver-->>Sender: RTCPinReceivingResponse::Ok
            else Wrong PIN
                Receiver-->>Sender: RTCPinReceivingResponse::PinRequired
            else Too many attempts
                Receiver-->>Sender: RTCPinReceivingResponse::TooManyAttempts
                Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: TooManyAttempts (closed)
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Sender PIN Verification
    alt Sender requires PIN
        Note over Receiver: Status: PinRequired
        loop Until correct PIN or max attempts
            Receiver->>Sender: RTCPinMessage {pin}
            alt Correct PIN
                Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPinSendingResponse::Ok {files}
            else Wrong PIN
                Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPinSendingResponse::PinRequired
            else Too many attempts
                Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPinSendingResponse::TooManyAttempts
                Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: TooManyAttempts (closed)
            end
        end
    else No PIN required
        Sender->>Receiver: RTCPinSendingResponse::Ok {files}
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: Connected

    Note over Receiver: User selects files
    alt User declines transfer
        Receiver->>Sender: RTCFileListResponse::Declined
        Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: Declined (closed)
    else User requests pairing
        Receiver->>Sender: RTCFileListResponse::Pair {publicKey}
        Note over Sender: Verify token with public key
        alt User accepts pairing
            Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPairResponse::Ok {publicKey}
            Receiver->>Sender: RTCFileListResponse::Ok {file_tokens}
        else User declines pairing
            Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPairResponse::PairDeclined
            Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection closed
        else Invalid signature
            Sender-->>Receiver: RTCPairResponse::InvalidSignature
            Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection closed
        end
    else User accepts transfer
        Receiver->>Sender: RTCFileListResponse::Ok {file_tokens}
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: File Transfer
    loop For each selected file
        Sender->>Receiver: RTCSendFileHeaderRequest {id, token}
        Note over Receiver: Validate token
        loop Send file in chunks
            Sender->>Receiver: Binary Data (16 KiB chunks)
        end
        Sender->>Receiver: Delimiter ("0")
        Note over Receiver: Process and save file
        Receiver-->>Sender: RTCSendFileResponse {id, success, error?}
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Transfer Complete
    Sender->>Receiver: Final Delimiter
    Note over Sender,Receiver: Status: Finished
    Note over Sender: Close data channel & peer connection
    Note over Receiver: Close peer connection
